bove or below the season's mean in proportion to the other league's clubs; within its league a club stands (W% − ½ − f × Δ) ÷ ((1 − f) × n/(n − 1) + f) above its league's mean, f the share of its league's games that were interleague and n the clubs of its league; m 0.0252, the win share a point of strength is worth in the engine under 2016's rules. Every player of the club moves by one whole number and the best few of its lineup by one more, so nobody passes a teammate.","licence":"WAR: JEFFBAGWELL (Neil Paine), MIT. Names, birthplaces, clubs and ballparks: the Baseball Databank (Chadwick Baseball Bureau), CC BY-SA 3.0; its home games from Retrosheet. See public/baseball/ATTRIBUTION.txt.","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Neil-Paine-1/MLB-WAR-data-historical/1c8c3084d62112efdaa7054125af3cd01003e38d/jeffbagwell_war_historical_2025.csv","retrieved":"2026-11-10","rawScale":"WAR"},"map":"mlb2016","nations":{"124":[65,14,[["Russell Martin","C/2B",85],["Joey Votto","1B",88],["Justin Morneau","1B",73],["Brett Lawrie","2B/3B",75],["Michael Saunders","LF/CF/RF",75],["Dalton Pompey","LF/CF",65],["James Paxton","SP",77],["John Axford","RP",74],["Rob Zastryzny","RP",64],["Jim Henderson","RP",62],["Dustin Molleken","RP",60],["Andrew Albers","RP",56],["Adam Loewen","RP",54],["Scott Diamond","RP",53]]],"156":[46,1,[["Austin Brice","RP",54]]],"158":[49,3,[["Wei-Yin Chen","SP",72],["Chien-Ming Wang","RP",64],["Chin-hui Tsao","RP",53]]],"170":[52,6,[["Jorge Alfaro","C",54],["Donovan Solano","2B/3B/SS",69],["Jose Quintana","SP",84],["Julio Teheran","SP",81],["Dayan Diaz","RP",55],["Tayron Guerrero","RP",55]]],"192":[77,21,[["Yasmani Grandal","C/1B",82],["Brayan Pena","C/1B",68],["Jose Abreu","1B",80],["Yonder Alonso","1B/3B",75],["Kendrys Morales","1B/RF",74],["Yunel Escobar","3B/SS",77],["Adonis Garcia","3B/LF",72],["Aledmys Diaz","SS",78],["Jose Iglesias","SS",77],["Adeiny Hechavarria","SS",73],["Yoenis Cespedes","LF/CF",84],["Leonys Martin","CF",80],["Yasiel Puig","RF/LF/CF"